{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the original version of Approaching Infinity as well as hats and new ship images for the 2025 Steam version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Approaching Infinity Classic:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final version of the game from 2020, before it was released on Steam Early Access.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It feels like the &quot;arcade&quot; version of Approaching Infinity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smaller screen, bigger challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hailing, scanning, grenades, or activated skills. NO SURRENDER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains all 12 faction quest lines, including 9 victories.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plus:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For the 2025 version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your ship's appearance to one of over 70 at any time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/extras/ship_breaker_4.png?t=1748546861\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Option to unlock all ships and officer classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...<i>and</i>...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HATS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/extras/HatsYall2.png?t=1748546861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gives a whole new meaning to the word &quot;character&quot;...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently 64 hats to choose from, and they're available both in new and existing games. Just go to the officers screen and select &quot;Hat&quot; to try them on today!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More about the Classic Version:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;classic&quot; version is the final release from the pre-Steam era, a full game in its own right, simpler and less forgiving. It's launched from within the Steam version, but runs as a standalone application. It won't interfere with your existing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723910?t=1748546861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723910?t=1748546861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/822f1d7fc95d97967e72dcd1a0e936ed44f0f4b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748546861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/822f1d7fc95d97967e72dcd1a0e936ed44f0f4b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748546861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the original version of Approaching Infinity as well as hats and new ship images for the 2025 Steam version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Approaching Infinity Classic:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final version of the game from 2020, before it was released on Steam Early Access.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It feels like the &quot;arcade&quot; version of Approaching Infinity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smaller screen, bigger challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hailing, scanning, grenades, or activated skills. NO SURRENDER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains all 12 faction quest lines, including 9 victories.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plus:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For the 2025 version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your ship's appearance to one of over 70 at any time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/extras/ship_breaker_4.png?t=1748546861\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Option to unlock all ships and officer classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...<i>and</i>...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HATS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723910/extras/HatsYall2.png?t=1748546861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gives a whole new meaning to the word &quot;character&quot;...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently 64 hats to choose from, and they're available both in new and existing games. Just go to the officers screen and select &quot;Hat&quot; to try them on today!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More about the Classic Version:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;classic&quot; version is the final release from the pre-Steam era, a full game in its own right, simpler and less forgiving. It's launched from within the Steam version, but runs as a standalone application. It won't interfere with your existing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["IBOL"],"fullgame":{"appid":"551620","name":"Approaching Infinity"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse